

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:13
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_43d50239:

    # "With the sounds of iron and steel reverberating into the sky, we marched towards the gate into the city."
    "Con los sonidos del hierro y el acero reverberando en el cielo, marchamos hacia la puerta de entrada a la ciudad."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:14
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_da340953:

    # "Our forces had been bolstered with a hundred strong cavalry men from another division, whatever this ‘secret’ mission was, it must be very important."
    "Nuestras fuerzas habían sido reforzadas con un centenar de fuertes hombres de caballería de otra división, fuera lo que fuera esta misión ‘secreta’, debía ser muy importante."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:16
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_31c1d805:

    # "Crowds came out to cheer us along the way, held back by rows of city guards acting as barriers so we could pass through unhindered."
    "La multitud salió a vitorearnos a lo largo del camino, contenida por hileras de guardias de la ciudad que hacían de barrera para que pudiéramos pasar sin obstáculos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:17
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_f3d4e862:

    # "Even with the adulation from the public, the tone was sombre given the many previous failed missions the Scouts had been made to embark on."
    "Incluso con la adulación del público, el tono era sombrío, dadas las numerosas misiones anteriores fallidas en las que se había hecho emprender a los exploradores."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:18
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_4a0e88d2:

    # "Some openly sobbed, others desperately tried to cheer us on with cries of \"Go get em’ boys!\" and \"Come home safe!\"."
    "Algunos sollozaban abiertamente, otros intentaban desesperadamente animarnos con gritos de \"¡A por ellos, chicos!\" y \"¡Volved a casa sanos y salvos!\"."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:19
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_e69e1431:

    # "Suddenly, from the side, I heard a familiar voice cry out to me."
    "De repente, desde un lado, oí una voz familiar que me gritaba."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:15
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_78263ad0:

    # REGINA @ talk "[player_name!t]! [player_name!t]!"
    REGINA @ talk "¡[player_name!t]! ¡[player_name!t]!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:23
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_d9748f84:

    # "Upon hearing the sweet voice and realising who it was, I looked over across the immense crowd and saw her among it as she desperately reached out to wave and cheer me on."
    "Al oír la dulce voz y darme cuenta de quién era, miré a la inmensa multitud y la vi en medio de ella mientras extendía desesperadamente la mano para saludarme y animarme."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:18
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_d7e14922:

    # MC "[regina_ref_cap!t]!"
    MC "¡[regina_ref_cap!t]!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:19
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_dd7a3de5:

    # REGINA @ talk "[player_name!t]! [player_name!t]! Come home safe! I love you!"
    REGINA @ talk "¡[player_name!t]! ¡[player_name!t]! ¡Vuelve a casa a salvo! ¡Te quiero!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:27
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_75f1da76:

    # "She was swept back by the tidal wave of people as she struggled to keep herself behind the barriers set up, waving frantically towards me."
    "Se vio arrastrada hacia atrás por el maremágnum de gente mientras luchaba por mantenerse detrás de las barreras, saludándome frenéticamente con la mano."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:28
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_8038d5d9:

    # "Damn..."
    "Maldición..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:29
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_a735250d:

    # "We marched on through the throngs of people, as we approached the archway to leave my ears picked another familiar voice from the crowd."
    "Avanzamos entre la multitud y, cuando nos acercamos al pórtico para marcharnos, mis oídos captaron otra voz familiar entre la multitud."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:25
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_9f20f220:

    # ADARA @ sad "[player_name!t]!"
    ADARA @ sad "¡[player_name!t]!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:32
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_cd3c31fb:

    # "Somehow Adara had managed to burst through the rows of guards keeping the crowds back and sprinted towards me, leaping on me in a frenzied embrace, tears welling in her eyes."
    "De algún modo, Adara había logrado atravesar las filas de guardias que contenían a la multitud y corrió hacia mí, saltando sobre mí en un abrazo frenético, con lágrimas en los ojos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:33
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_2e5d551e:

    # MC "Adara, what are you doing here? You should be—"
    MC "Adara, ¿qué haces aquí? Deberías estar—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:35
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_f00b98b9:

    # ADARA @ sad "I had to come! I had to say goodbye!"
    ADARA @ sad "¡Tenía que venir! ¡Tenía que despedirme!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:36
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_b007e3a5:

    # MC "Adara..."
    MC "Adara..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:38
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_0c094b67:

    # "Without hesitation, Adara sprung forward and planted a kiss onto my lips, her fingers twined through my hair as she clung to me one last time."
    "Sin vacilar, Adara saltó hacia delante y me plantó un beso en los labios, sus dedos se enredaron en mi pelo mientras se aferraba a mí por última vez."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:33
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_a2155810:

    # ADARA @ sad "G-Goodluck, [player_name!t]!"
    ADARA @ sad "¡B-buena suerte, [player_name!t]!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:40
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_19748f64:

    # MC "... Adara... I..."
    MC "... Adara... yo..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:41
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_205d5740:

    # ADARA @ sad "C-Come home, please, to me!"
    ADARA @ sad "¡V-Vuelve a casa, por favor, a mí!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:43
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_5989b69b:

    # "The guards began to pull Adara away, she cried out to me in anguish, her hands still outstretched."
    "Los guardias empezaron a apartar a Adara, que me gritaba angustiada con las manos aún extendidas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:40
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_8d6c5e6e:

    # GUARD "GET BACK! Get back I say!"
    GUARD "¡ATRÁS! ¡He dicho que atrás!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:41
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_faad54e7:

    # ADARA @ sad "{i}Come home, [player_name!t]!{/i}"
    ADARA @ sad "{i}¡Vuelve a casa, [player_name!t]!{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:48
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_284b806f:

    # ADARA @ sad "I’ll be waiting for you!"
    ADARA @ sad "¡Te estaré esperando!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:52
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_74f83b13:

    # "I shook my head to try and regain some focus as our procession marched out into the Valley of Death."
    "Sacudí la cabeza para intentar concentrarme mientras nuestra procesión se adentraba en el Valle de la Muerte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:58
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_46e46050:

    # "We marched for hours along the desolate, barren roads of this dead world."
    "Marchamos durante horas por las desoladas y estériles caminos de este mundo muerto."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:59
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_ee910ba6:

    # "Here and there were scorched out wooden houses long since abandoned and overturned carts still laden with rotten food."
    "Aquí y allá había casas de madera chamuscadas abandonadas hacía mucho tiempo y carretas volcadas aún cargadas de comida podrida."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:60
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_ddb3e81f:

    # "Much of this land was utterly devastated during The Great Siege of Novaras in 1152, turning much of the surrounding land into a dustbowl."
    "Gran parte de estas tierras fueron devastadas durante el Gran Asedio de Novaras en 1152, convirtiendo gran parte de las tierras circundantes en una polvareda."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:61
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_96e63e82:

    # "However, if you were able to survive long enough to venture to the other side, greenery could once again be found."
    "Sin embargo, si eras capaz de sobrevivir lo suficiente para aventurarte al otro lado, podías volver a encontrar vegetación."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:62
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_308be420:

    # "The roads were littered with the skeletal remains of previous travellers."
    "Los caminos estaban sembrados de restos óseos de viajeros anteriores."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:63
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_d32561da:

    # "Perhaps most ominously of all, in one burned out hut we have found what was left of a family sitting at a dinner table, their bones now lost amongst the carcass of their meal."
    "Lo más inquietante de todo es que en una cabaña quemada hemos encontrado lo que quedaba de una familia sentada a la mesa, con los huesos perdidos entre los restos de la comida."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:64
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_cac73c98:

    # "In the mad rush to Novaras during the war, hundreds in their droves fled to the Capital, the last {i}true{/i} safe haven at the time."
    "En la loca avalancha hacia Novaras durante la guerra, cientos de personas huyeron en masa a la Capital, el último {i}verdadero{/i} refugio seguro en aquel momento."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:65
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_3832acc8:

    # "Many starved along the way and many were lost in the congested crowds to be trampled and left on the wayside."
    "Muchos murieron de hambre por el camino y otros muchos se perdieron entre la multitud y fueron pisoteados y abandonados en el camino."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:66
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_d366a6d1:

    # "It was only thanks to Emperor Alcott, then just the son of a fledgling lord who had died some months prior, who’d rallied together the bannermen and held off the onslaught of Demorai while the others squabbled and bickered amongst themselves."
    "Solo gracias al emperador Alcott, que entonces era solo el hijo de un señor incipiente que había muerto unos meses antes, había reunido a los portaestandartes y resistido la embestida de demorai mientras los demás se peleaban y discutían entre ellos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:67
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_ad343ca4:

    # "Mesamor must have been pleased and presumed Alcott may prove to be the next Newheart."
    "Mesamor debió de alegrarse y presumió que Alcott podría convertirse en el próximo Newheart."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:68
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_b85d83e9:

    # "I doubt in a million years that he would have predicted that Alcott would one day rise up and overthrow him."
    "Dudo en un millón de años que hubiera predicho que Alcott se rebelaría un día y lo derrocaría."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:73
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_9ee03850:

    # DUPREY "ONWARD MARCH!"
    DUPREY "¡MARCHA HACIA ADELANTE!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:75
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_3cc36384:

    # "Captain Duprey himself rode by horse, leading us from the front. We constantly peered out across the deadlands for any signs of the Demorai, but rather unnervingly could not locate even a whisper of them."
    "El propio capitán Duprey iba a caballo, dirigiéndonos desde el frente. Mirábamos constantemente a través de las tierras muertas en busca de cualquier señal de los Demorai, pero no pudimos localizar ni siquiera un rastro de ellos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:78
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_d277cc6e:

    # "A couple hours into the slow, tedious march, the young First Officer rode up along beside us on a horse and peered down inquisitively."
    "Al cabo de un par de horas de la lenta y tediosa marcha, el joven primer oficial subió a caballo a nuestro lado y se acercó inquisitivamente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:80
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_8dda77c4:

    # "Second in command to Captain Duprey, he was notorious for being a dry, unemotional man."
    "Segundo al mando del capitán Duprey, tenía fama de ser un hombre seco y sin emociones."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:82
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_d63beaa1:

    # BORRAS "You three, come with me."
    BORRAS "Vosotros tres, venid conmigo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:83
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_5a5784d5:

    # "Me, Markus and Kiara shared a look, all of us confused."
    "Markus, Kiara y yo compartimos una mirada, todos confundidos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:85
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_def6eabf:

    # BORRAS "Yes, you three idiots, come, now."
    BORRAS "Sí, vosotros tres idiotas, venid, ahora."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:89
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_29aaa368:

    # "Uneasy, we strayed away from the main bulk of the force and followed Borras down towards the front of the line towards Captain Duprey."
    "Inquietos, nos alejamos del grupo principal y seguimos a Borras hacia el frente de la línea, hacia el capitán Duprey."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:93
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_3e19d25d:

    # BORRAS "Captain, I’d like to give these Scouts some horses so they can come with me and loop around onto the ridge of the gorge."
    BORRAS "Capitán, me gustaría darles caballos a estos exploradores para que vengan conmigo y den la vuelta a la ladera del desfiladero."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:94
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_352d9cf7:

    # "The Captain gave us a cursory glance."
    "El capitán nos echó una mirada fulminante."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:95
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_19e696bc:

    # DUPREY "... With just these three?"
    DUPREY "... ¿Con solo estos tres?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:97
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_1fe10c4e:

    # BORRAS "I think we’ll draw too much attention with any more. It’s unlikely, but the Demorai may have used the gorge to lay a trap."
    BORRAS "Creo que llamaremos demasiado la atención con más. Es poco probable, pero los demorai pueden haber usado el desfiladero para tender una trampa."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:98
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_ee7738ae:

    # DUPREY "Hmm, permission granted, but make sure you’re careful with any engagement."
    DUPREY "Hmm, permiso concedido, pero asegúrate de tener cuidado con cualquier combate."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:100
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_ae730759:

    # BORRAS "Yes Captain, I’ll ride back and report if there’s any trouble."
    BORRAS "Sí Capitán, volveré e informaré si hay algún problema."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:102
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_7de322a9:

    # "Borras whistled and waved over some of the men who trotted the horses over towards us."
    "Borras silbó e hizo señas a algunos de los hombres que hicieron trotar a los caballos hacia nosotros."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:103
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_5196c965:

    # "Taking the reins of the horses he handed them to each of us."
    "Cogió las riendas de los caballos y nos las dio a cada uno."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:104
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_672f0a56:

    # BORRAS "I take it you can all ride?"
    BORRAS "¿Supongo que todos sabéis montar?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:105
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_06928b06:

    # MARKUS "Yes."
    MARKUS "Sí."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:106
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_617596c2:

    # KIARA "Aye."
    KIARA "Sí."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:107
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_34986cf2:

    # MC "Uhh, somewhat."
    MC "Uhh, un poco."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:109
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_d20687d6:

    # BORRAS "‘Somewhat’?"
    BORRAS "¿‘Un poco’?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:110
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_01a2fa01:

    # MC "It’s been a while, sir..."
    MC "Ha pasado mucho tiempo, señor..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:111
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_f7f37700:

    # MC "Can I ask why you’re taking us and not more experienced cavalry?"
    MC "¿Puedo preguntarle por qué nos lleva a nosotros y no a una caballería más experimentada?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:113
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_0938623b:

    # BORRAS "I’m not risking cavalry men, you lot die, I just need to find a couple of new horses."
    BORRAS "No voy a arriesgar hombres de caballería, si mueren, solo necesito encontrar un par de caballos nuevos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:115
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_cf030dfb:

    # BORRAS "They die and I’m looking at months of training to get new recruits up to {i}my{/i} standards."
    BORRAS "Si ellos mueren, yo tendré que entrenar durante meses para que los nuevos reclutas alcancen {i}mis{/i} estándares."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:116
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_9d2b800f:

    # "Well... that’s not very confidence inspiring."
    "Bueno... eso no inspira mucha confianza."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:118
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_cca1be84:

    # BORRAS "Now, enough questions! Come!"
    BORRAS "¡Basta de preguntas! ¡Vamos!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:126
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_b3d75520:

    # "Riding up behind Borras, we furtively looped around to the high ground of the ridge."
    "Cabalgando detrás de Borras, dimos la vuelta sigilosamente hasta el terreno elevado de ladera."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:127
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_c4e0e0aa:

    # "If there were any Demorai waiting up there, they could easily clamber down from the sides and surround the men in minutes."
    "Si hubiera algún demorai esperando allí arriba, podría bajar fácilmente por los lados y rodear a los hombres en cuestión de minutos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:128
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_a72abee1:

    # "Thankfully, as we trotted up to overlook the valley beneath, we couldn’t see any enemies lurking."
    "Afortunadamente, mientras trotábamos hacia el valle, no vimos a ningún enemigo al acecho."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:129
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_671404c3:

    # "{i}But...{/i} I had an eerie feeling we were being watched by something, somewhere..."
    "{i}Pero...{/i} Tenía la extraña sensación de que algo nos observaba, en algún lugar..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:131
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_0126a5da:

    # BORRAS "Hmph... Looks like the path is clear."
    BORRAS "Hmph... Parece que el camino está despejado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:133
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_b17da576:

    # KIARA "Are we done here then?"
    KIARA "¿Hemos terminado aquí entonces?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:134
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_246621e2:

    # BORRAS "Yes, we’re—"
    BORRAS "Sí, estamos—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:136
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_299bf44a:

    # "Bursting out of the sand, a dozen Demorai surrounded us!" with flash
