# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:172
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_8d2697e9:

    # "We rode back with Borras, grateful to be re-joining our ranks."
    "Volvimos con Borras, agradecidos de volver a unirnos a nuestras filas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:174
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_e4dde03b:

    # "Flooded with adrenaline and in spite of the blood now seeping into the cracks of our armour, we were exhilarated at not only having survived, but having been {i}victorious{/i} over our enemies."
    "Inundados de adrenalina y a pesar de la sangre que ahora se filtraba por las grietas de nuestra armadura, estábamos exultantes no solo por haber sobrevivido, sino por haber {i}vencido{/i} a nuestros enemigos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:176
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_MarchOut_79c3bbe6:

    # "Even though we knew we had only fought a fledgling force, it was our first real taste of battle... and victory."
