    # KIARA "Get out of the way!"
    KIARA "¡Quítate de en medio!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:856
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_d2a55f19:

    # "Horrified, Borras froze in fear before he moved to grab his sword, but it was too late."
    "Horrorizado, Borras se congeló de miedo antes de moverse para coger su espada, pero ya era demasiado tarde."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:861
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_15d262ef:

    # "A toxic acid spewed from the thing’s mouth, Borras tried to roll to dodge the blast but was quickly engulfed and left writhing in agony, animal like cries shuddering through him."
    "Un ácido tóxico brotó de la boca de la cosa, Borras trató de rodar para esquivar la ráfaga, pero fue rápidamente engullido y quedó retorciéndose de agonía, con gritos como de animal estremeciéndose a través de él."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:862
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_2d77f11e:

    # "Desperately, he clawed at his own melting face before becoming deathly quiet, limply turning to face us one with only the sizzling sounds of the acid still dissolving through his bones."
    "Desesperado, se arañó el rostro derretido antes de quedarse en un silencio sepulcral, volviéndose cojeando hacia nosotros con el único sonido del ácido disolviéndose en sus huesos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:864
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_f15fdca9:

    # "His eyes blinked in disbelief that he was about to die, with a trembling hand he tried to motion something with his sword."
    "Sus ojos parpadearon con la incredulidad de que estaba a punto de morir, con una mano temblorosa intentó mover algo con su espada."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:865
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_716bc802:

    # "There was nothing but horror etched onto what was left of his face before he collapsed, raising the sword up as if he was going to plunge it into himself."
    "No había más que horror grabado en lo que quedaba de su rostro antes de desplomarse, levantando la espada como si fuera a clavársela a sí mismo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:866
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_ad1aafe6:

    # "Instead, he planted it in the ground allowing it to take the weight of what we witnessed become his corpse, perhaps in a position he deemed more dignified than lying at the feet of the Demorai that killed him."
    "En lugar de ello, lo plantó en el suelo permitiendo que soportara el peso de lo que presenciamos convertido en su cadáver, quizá en una posición que consideraba más digna que yacer a los pies del demorai que lo mató."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:875
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_acc7c430:

    # DUPREY "ON ME!"
    DUPREY "¡SEGUIDME!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:888
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_1b3652e9:

    # "Exhausted and at our breaking point, we watched as the thing slumped over to its side, bloodied and taking staggered breaths."
    "Agotados y al límite de nuestras fuerzas, vimos cómo la cosa se desplomaba sobre un costado, ensangrentada y respirando entrecortadamente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:889
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_a13bee82:

    # "Captain Duprey stormed towards it as it squirmed in agony, trying to drag itself away."
    "El capitán Duprey se abalanzó sobre la criatura, que se retorcía de dolor tratando de alejarse."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:890
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_87fa56d5:

    # "Swinging his axe down one last time onto the thing’s head, in one clean cut Duprey eviscerated its skull and pierced through to its brain."
    "Girando su hacha una última vez sobre la cabeza de la cosa, de un corte limpio Duprey evisceró su cráneo y perforó a través de su cerebro."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:894
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_3fc9c07e:

    # "We all looked around in horror as we waited for what was to happen next, slowly the Captain turned to look at us with lifeless eyes."
    "Todos miramos a nuestro alrededor horrorizados mientras esperábamos lo que iba a ocurrir a continuación, lentamente el capitán se giró para mirarnos con ojos sin vida."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:897
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_7f8a03ed:

    # MARKUS "... C-Captain... It... It just...."
    MARKUS "... C-Capitán... Es... Es solo...."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:898
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_8098a9e5:

    # DUPREY "... We’re nearly there. Come on...."
    DUPREY "... Ya casi llegamos. Vamos....."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:899
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_118a43a1:

    # MARKUS "But we—"
    MARKUS "Pero nosotros—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:900
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_4e07c4e9:

    # DUPREY "{i}Come. On.{/i}"
    DUPREY "{i}Va-mos.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:901
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_fdb0e643:

    # "As Markus stared at Borras’ corpse, frozen in horror, the Captain put his hand almost tenderly on his shoulder."
    "Mientras Markus contemplaba horrorizado el cadáver de Borras, el capitán le puso la mano en el hombro casi con ternura."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:902
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_b72d9ec2:

    # DUPREY "We keep moving, you understand?"
    DUPREY "Seguimos adelante, ¿entiendes?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:903
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_42029655:

    # "Markus nodded weakly."
    "Markus asintió débilmente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:905
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_acfa9909:

    # "Staggering towards his horse, the Captain clambered onto it and began to trot on ahead."
    "Tambaleándose hacia su caballo, el capitán se subió a él y empezó a trotar hacia delante."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:907
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e8141954:

    # "The men, horrified at what they had just witnessed, once again fell into place behind him."
    "Los hombres, horrorizados por lo que acababan de presenciar, volvieron a colocarse detrás de él."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:908
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_fd3fd31f:

    # "By now, any optimism we had felt since our first small battle on the ridge was really and truly gone."
    "A estas alturas, todo el optimismo que habíamos sentido desde nuestra primera pequeña batalla en la ladera se había esfumado de verdad."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:909
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_f3c22127:

    # "We had all been brutally reminded that out here, we were not the hunters, but the {i}hunted{/i}."
    "A todos nos habían recordado brutalmente que aquí no éramos los cazadores, sino los {i}cazados{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:919
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c21cf7c5:

    # "More than a week passed since Borras’ death."
    "Pasó más de una semana desde la muerte de Borras."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:920
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_7cd181f4:

    # "Days and days of travelling on mercilessly, Duprey pushing us harder and harder, fuelled by the death of his friend."
    "Días y días de viaje sin piedad, Duprey empujándonos cada vez más fuerte, alimentado por la muerte de su amigo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:921
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_48ad92c6:

    # "We found ourselves marching through the thick, seemingly endless forest, every snap of a twig set us on edge as we looked out for enemies that might be lurking."
    "Nos encontramos marchando por un bosque espeso y aparentemente interminable, cada chasquido de una ramita nos ponía en vilo mientras buscábamos enemigos que pudieran estar al acecho."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:922
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_15d0ae3b:

    # "I’d never before felt so vulnerable whilst being surrounded by so many people."
    "Nunca me había sentido tan vulnerable rodeado de tanta gente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:923
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e2d2b968:

    # "I marvelled over how we’d proceeded so long on this journey, carelessly allowing ourselves the hope that we might just be alright."
    "Me maravillé de cómo habíamos avanzado tanto en este viaje, permitiéndonos despreocupadamente la esperanza de que podríamos estar bien."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:924
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_af5902e0:

    # "Now I found my heart was always racing."
    "Ahora descubrí que mi corazón siempre estaba acelerado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:925
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_ef9db5b9:

    # "I allowed the fear to wash over me every morning, I depended on it to keep me on edge."
    "Permití que el miedo me invadiera cada mañana, dependía de él para mantenerme en vilo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:926
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_ed8f2bdd:

    # "Sleep was nightmare after nightmare, I made sure that whenever I did manage to steal a few hours of rest that my sword was always within arm’s reach."
    "El sueño era una pesadilla tras otra, me aseguraba de que siempre que conseguía robar unas horas de descanso, mi espada estaba al alcance de la mano."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:927
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_093c96fb:

    # "Finally, just as the rain began to hammer down onto the ground and dark grey clouds circled overhead, we arrived at the fort."
    "Finalmente, justo cuando la lluvia empezaba a arreciar sobre el suelo y oscuras nubes grises se cernían sobre nosotros, llegamos al fuerte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:931
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_85b5b56a:

    # "As we trudged our way inside the mud-soaked fort through what was left of the gate, we looked around at the dismal lifelessness of the place."
    "Mientras avanzábamos penosamente hacia el interior del fuerte empapado de barro a través de lo que quedaba de la puerta, observamos a nuestro alrededor la lúgubre falta de vida del lugar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:933
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_88fc8c4d:

    # "There was no sign of anyone and there hadn’t been for a while."
    "No había rastro de nadie y hacía tiempo que no lo había."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:934
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_0aca1b04:

    # "Here and there were scattered the ruinous remains of the old buildings and overturned fruit carts."
    "Aquí y allá se esparcían los restos ruinosos de los viejos edificios y carretas de fruta volcadas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:937
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c976be39:

    # "Perhaps most prominently, and propped up by the various wooden frames, was a colossal tunnel that had been dug into the mountain itself."
    "Quizás lo más destacado, y apuntalado por los diversos armazones de madera, era un colosal túnel que se había excavado en la propia montaña."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:938
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_079427da:

    # "Inside it was pitch black, but it was clear from the burned-out torches at the entrance that whoever had inhabited this place had spent a considerable amount of time in these tunnels."
    "El interior estaba completamente oscuro, pero las antorchas quemadas de la entrada dejaban claro que quienquiera que hubiera habitado este lugar había pasado una cantidad considerable de tiempo en estos túneles."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:939
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_6cf2b373:

    # "Captain Duprey looked around and then turned to us cautiously."
    "El capitán Duprey miró a su alrededor y luego se volvió hacia nosotros con cautela."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:945
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c7470f9d:

    # DUPREY "Right, on me, you lot."
    DUPREY "Bien, seguidme, vosotros."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:951
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_bd175ca6:

    # "With freshly lit torches, we followed Captain Duprey deeper into the tunnel."
    "Con las antorchas recién encendidas, seguimos al capitán Duprey hacia el interior del túnel."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:952
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_3217bf80:

    # "It seemed to drag on endlessly, meandering up and down, delving deeper and deeper into the mountain."
    "Parecía prolongarse sin fin, serpenteando arriba y abajo, adentrándose cada vez más en la montaña."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:953
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e1df4315:

    # "We finally reached a formidable stone wall blocking our way, inscribed with strange markings I was not familiar with."
    "Por fin llegamos a una formidable muralla de piedra que bloqueaba nuestro camino, inscrito con extrañas marcas que yo desconocía."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:954
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_94a75c24:

    # "As the Captain gently touched his hand on its cold wet surface, the inscribed markings began to glow an ominous red and he stepped back, more cautious than I’d ever seen him."
    "Mientras el capitán tocaba suavemente con la mano su fría y húmeda superficie, las marcas inscritas empezaron a brillar con un ominoso color rojo y dio un paso atrás, más cauteloso de lo que nunca le había visto."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:957
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e411519c:

    # DUPREY "Hmm..."
    DUPREY "Hmm..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:960
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_e67c2c91:

    # "He looked back at the others and whistled."
    "Miró a los demás y silbó."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:961
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_f242c681:

    # DUPREY "Get one of those mages down here now!"
    DUPREY "¡Traed a una de esas magas aquí ahora!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:962
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_1ef1e65a:

    # DUPREY "I’ll bet any one of you a keg of rum that what we’re looking for is behind here."
    DUPREY "Me apuesto un barril de ron a que lo que buscamos está aquí detrás."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:966
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_edba64a4:

    # "As a couple of the mages rushed forward, they frantically began to inspect the inscription, running their hands over it and muttering to themselves."
    "En cuanto un par de magas se abalanzaron sobre la inscripción, empezaron a inspeccionarla frenéticamente, pasándose las manos por encima y murmurando para sus adentros."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:969
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c8092128:

    # MAGE "This may take us some time to open, Captain."
    MAGE "Esto puede llevarnos algún tiempo abrirlo, capitán."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:971
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_a4f83352:

    # DUPREY "Hurry as quick as you can, I don’t like being caught in this forsaken place."
    DUPREY "Daos tanta prisa como podáis, no me gusta estar atrapado en este lugar abandonado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:972
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_3142b6d0:

    # DUPREY "MEN! TAKE POSITIONS ON THE FORT! SECURE THE AREA!"
    DUPREY "¡HOMBRES! ¡TOMEN POSICIONES EN EL FUERTE! ¡ASEGURAD LA ZONA!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:976
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_3f5bdf35:

    # "We leapt to attention at his order and made our way out once again into the fort."
    "Nos pusimos firmes a su orden y salimos de nuevo al fuerte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:977
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_cc451534:

    # MC "(Wonder what’s behind that thing?)"
    MC "(Me pregunto qué habrá detrás de esa cosa)."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:980
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_a8bb7d00:

    # "The men moved to take positions around the remnants of the fort."
    "Los hombres tomaron posiciones alrededor de los restos del fuerte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:981
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_8aa761bc:

    # "Nervous, I went and asked for some supplies from the supply wagon."
    "Nervioso, fui a pedir provisiones a la carreta de suministros."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:984
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_734778e3:

    # "There was an eerie silence as we waited and watched impatiently, each of us wondering what had happened here, most of us too scared to voice our ideas."
    "Se hizo un silencio espeluznante mientras esperábamos y observábamos impacientes, cada uno de nosotros preguntándose qué había ocurrido aquí, la mayoría demasiado asustados para expresar nuestras ideas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:985
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_c03a767e:

    # "Painted on the face of every man and woman was the unease of the realisation that we were sitting ducks."
    "En el rostro de todos los hombres y mujeres se reflejaba el malestar de saber que éramos presa fácil."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:986
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_da552107:

    # "We could do nothing more than pray that the seal would open and we could collect whatever was behind it quickly and leave this haunted place in our memories."
    "No podíamos hacer otra cosa que rezar para que el sello se abriera y pudiéramos recoger rápidamente lo que hubiera detrás y dejar este lugar embrujado en nuestros recuerdos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:987
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_LeaveCampToBurnedOutVillage_5092d10a:

    # "Restless, I was pacing from one watch spot to another."
    "Inquieto, me paseaba de un punto de vigilancia a otro."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:996
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_ed8e8a66:

    # "Markus, much like me, was nervously patrolling the fort grounds."
    "Markus, al igual que yo, patrullaba nervioso los terrenos del fuerte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:997
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_5d8f8894:

    # "He feigned an awkward smile as I approached but the tension on his face was obvious. "
    "Fingió una sonrisa incómoda mientras me acercaba, pero la tensión en su rostro era evidente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:998
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_f2d0c1fa:

    # MARKUS "Hey, everything alright?"
    MARKUS "Oye, ¿todo bien?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:999
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_afc8cc1f:

    # MC "Yeah..."
    MC "Sí..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1000
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_0aa9896e:

    # MC "... What do you think of this place?"
    MC "... ¿Qué piensas de este lugar?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1001
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_b23ea5da:

    # MARKUS "I think it’s a lot of bad news..."
    MARKUS "Creo que es lugar peligroso..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:993
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_927553e4:

    # MARKUS "No offence, [player_name!t], but the last thing I want to think about right now is that."
    MARKUS "No te lo tomes a mal, [player_name!t], pero lo último en lo que quiero pensar ahora mismo es en eso."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1005
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_1ed3230d:

    # MC "Right, sorry."
    MC "Cierto, lo siento."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1006
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_TalkToMarkusInAbandFort_feea6f2c:

    # MARKUS " ... {i}His face...{/i}"
