    MARKUS "Ciertamente estaban trabajando duro para resolver... {i}algo{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1427
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_8c77d8f3:

    # "Apprehensively, the two of us finally made our way over to the obelisks."
    "Con aprensión, los dos nos dirigimos finalmente hacia los obeliscos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1428
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_3c0f14f6:

    # "As I listened closely, I could almost hear a... {i}a heartbeat?{/i}"
    "Al escuchar atentamente, casi podía oír un... {i}¿un latido?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1429
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_6256818a:

    # MARKUS "What are these things?"
    MARKUS "¿Qué son estas cosas?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1430
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_8cac275a:

    # "Feeling a gnawing urge to reach out and touch the monument, I rested my hand on its ice-cold surface."
    "Sentí una necesidad irresistible de tocar el monumento y apoyé la mano en su superficie helada."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1432
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_f151046e:

    # "I’ve noticed Markus doing the same..."
    "Me di cuenta de que Markus hacía lo mismo..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1433
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1a1e080a:

    # "This alone frightened me, and with a shudder I withdrew my hand just as fast."
    "Solo esto me asustó, y con un escalofrío retiré la mano con la misma rapidez."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1434
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c246b715:

