    "De repente, ambos monumentos empezaron a iluminarse con marcas de colores..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1441
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_63884bfb:

    # "We stepped back fearfully, holding out our swords and mustering the remainders of our strength, naively hoping to protect ourselves from whatever dark magic these stones were channeling."
    "Retrocedimos temerosos, empuñando nuestras espadas y haciendo acopio de lo que quedaba de nuestras fuerzas, con la ingenua esperanza de protegernos de la magia oscura que canalizaban esas piedras."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1442
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b13f2d6c:

    # MARKUS "Why did you touch it?!"
    MARKUS "¡¿Por qué lo tocaste?!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1443
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7f1d5238:

    # MC "I don’t know! I felt I had to—"
    MC "¡No lo sé! Sentí que tenía que—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1447
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5df8b429:

    # "{b}A black mass of slithering tentacles{/b} erupted from the monument I fixed my gaze upon."
    "{b}Una masa negra de tentáculos serpenteantes{/b} surgió del monumento en el que fijé mi mirada."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1448
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_4ff3e97c:

    # "Shocked, I instinctively tried to swing my sword at it, only to find my arm firmly locked in place, one of the squirmy limbs coiling tightly around it."
    "Sorprendido, instintivamente traté de golpearlo con mi espada, pero me encontré con que mi brazo estaba firmemente bloqueado y una de las largas extremidades se enroscaba con fuerza a su alrededor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1449
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_64fdced3:

    # "In an instant, I was engulfed by the dark entity."
    "En un instante, fui engullido por la entidad oscura."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1450
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1c5eec72:

    # "Unable to fight it I broke into a desperate struggle, primordial terror clawing its way into my very soul."
    "Incapaz de luchar contra él, me lancé a una lucha desesperada, con un terror primordial clavándose en mi alma."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1452
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_31afbfe4:

    # "The last thing I saw was Markus, devoured by a similar abomination bursting out from the second monument..."
    "Lo último que vi fue a Markus, devorado por una abominación similar que salía del segundo monumento..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1453
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_6ea3e288:

    # "...only of {i}pure white{/i}."
    "...únicamente de {i}blanco puro{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1465
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b5509755:

    # "Dark dreams circled in my head..."
    "Sueños oscuros daban vueltas en mi cabeza..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1466
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c2ef21b2:

    # "...visions of hundreds of naked women of all the different races I had never seen..."
    "...visiones de cientos de mujeres desnudas de todas las diferentes razas que nunca había visto..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1467
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_ac79c46e:

    # "...fawning over me desperately, moaning in intense pleasure as I sat on what seemed like a golden throne..."
    "...adulándome desesperadamente, gimiendo de intenso placer mientras me sentaba en lo que parecía un trono de oro..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1468
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_15801940:

    # "...storm clouds gathering overhead as lightning forked to the world below..."
    "...nubes de tormenta en lo alto mientras los relámpagos se bifurcaban hacia el mundo de abajo..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1482
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7ebda109:

    # "My eyes shot open as I sat bolt upright in horror."
    "Se me abrieron los ojos de golpe y me quedé sentado, horrorizado.."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1483
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_c8ca8afa:

    # "Drenched in sweat, I looked around frantically to get some sense of bearing on where I was."
    "Empapado en sudor, miré frenéticamente a mi alrededor para saber dónde estaba."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1484
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5f8b107a:

    # "I was sitting on one of many rows of beds made up in a stone-cold room."
    "Estaba sentado en una de las muchas filas de camas en una habitación fría como una piedra."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1486
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_af2e3de3:

    # "Looking around I realised I was in... {i}Fort Sebastian?{/i}"
    "Mirando a mi alrededor me di cuenta de que estaba en... {i}fuerte Sebastian?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1487
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_06f0eaca:

    # "{i}The medical ward{/i}?"
    "¿{i}El pabellón médico{/i}?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1465
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_be4d18bb:

    # MARKUS "[player_name!t]..."
    MARKUS "[player_name!t]..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1490
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_8cd3553f:

    # "I turned my head to look to my side, Markus was leaning on the wall near the next bed, looking even paler than usual, his eyes dark and foreboding."
