    "Cualquiera diría que estaba a las puertas de la muerte mientras me hablaba."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1492
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_dfd2fec5:

    # MC "How did we... {i}get here?{/i}"
    MC "¿Cómo hemos... {i}llegado hasta aquí?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1493
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_3feec716:

    # MARKUS "I don’t know... The nurses told me..."
    MARKUS "No lo sé... Las enfermeras me dijeron..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1494
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_2fb985d3:

    # MARKUS "They found us naked outside the gates."
    MARKUS "Nos encontraron desnudos fuera de las puertas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1495
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_077ab260:

    # MC "The gates? Are we—"
    MC "¿Las puertas? ¿Estamos—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1496
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_64a2f0c8:

    # MARKUS "Yeah... We’re home."
    MARKUS "Sí... Estamos en casa."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1497
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_87b6f681:

    # "Despite my mind being awash with questions, I could at least allow a deep sigh of relief that we had by some miracle survived {i}the horrors of that abandoned fort{/i}."
    "A pesar de que mi mente estaba inundada de preguntas, al menos pude permitirme un profundo suspiro de alivio al saber que, por algún milagro, habíamos sobrevivido {i}a los horrores de aquel fuerte abandonado{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1498
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_4b98f3a0:

    # "My mind turned to Captain Duprey, Borras... {i}Kiara...{/i}"
    "Mi mente se volvió hacia el capitán Duprey, Borras... {i}Kiara...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1499
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_92d4e80e:

    # "I heard a clanking sound approaching and looked towards it."
    "Oí un ruido metálico que se acercaba y miré hacia él."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1500
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_05f226df:

    # "A huge figure walked towards us, accompanied by four heavily armed guards and a beautiful mage."
    "Una enorme figura caminaba hacia nosotros, acompañada por cuatro guardias fuertemente armados y una hermosa maga."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1502
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7ff991c7:

    # "Naturally, the mage caught my wandering gaze, but just as I managed to focus a familiar, menacing voice opened up..."
    "Naturalmente, la maga captó mi mirada errante, pero justo cuando conseguí centrarme se oyó una voz familiar y amenazadora..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1510
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_68fb8823:

    # MENACING_VOICE "Check them both."
    MENACING_VOICE "Revísalos ambos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1511
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_665817ca:

    # BEAUTIFUL_MAGE "Of course, my lord."
    BEAUTIFUL_MAGE "Por supuesto, mi señor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1508
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_4dbe0bba:

    # "As the mage stepped forward, I could not help but stare at her chest, deep cutout of her robes displaying a fair portion of her breasts."
    "Mientras la maga se adelantaba, no pude evitar fijarme en su pecho, el profundo recorte de su túnica mostraba una buena parte de sus pechos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1509
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5a9888e7:

