    "Los latidos de mi corazón aumentaron, una oleada antinatural de pasión acarició mi debilitado cuerpo..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1510
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_f72558e8:

    # "She spoke in a soft, raspy voice, pointing her staff at me:"
    "Habló con voz suave y áspera, apuntándome con su bastón:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1516
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_9e803c89:

    # BEAUTIFUL_MAGE "Hold still."
    BEAUTIFUL_MAGE "No te muevas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1517
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_32a24889:

    # "Her staff lit up, warm light following its cryptic tip as she slowly held it over my body, head to toe."
    "Su bastón se iluminó con una luz cálida que seguía su punta misteriosa mientras lo sostenía lentamente sobre mi cuerpo, de la cabeza a los pies."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1518
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_b4bb5c70:

    # "Markus was next, the procedure seemingly soothing his aching psyche."
    "Markus fue el siguiente, el procedimiento parecía calmar su dolorida psique."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1519
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_324b2179:

    # "In a few moments the mage was through examining us."
    "En unos instantes, la maga terminó de examinarnos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1522
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_bbae3533:

    # "Her full, purple lips let out a conclusive mutter, then she spoke up:"
    "Sus labios carnosos y purpúreos dejaron escapar un murmullo concluyente, y luego tomó la palabra:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1528
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_9d14bd22:

    # BEAUTIFUL_MAGE "They do not possess magic, nor do they reek of any magical essence that shows they have been possessed or tainted by the Demorai’ magic."
    BEAUTIFUL_MAGE "No poseen magia, ni apestan a ninguna esencia mágica que demuestre que han sido poseídos o contaminados por la magia de los demorai."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1530
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_8e787395:

    # MENACING_VOICE "Thank you, Kylisa, you may go now."
    MENACING_VOICE "Gracias, Kylisa, ya puedes irte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1527
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_31cce257:

    # "Kylisa bowed, as she stepped away and left the ward."
    "Kylisa hizo una reverencia, mientras se alejaba y abandonaba el pabellón."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1529
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_5c00a2f0:

    # "Emperor Alcott’s attention was fully diverted to us now."
    "La atención del emperador Alcott estaba completamente dirigida hacia nosotros ahora."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1530
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_32ac97cc:

    # ALCOTT "It is good to see you awake."
    ALCOTT "Es bueno veros despiertos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1531
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_dacb22da:

    # ALCOTT "Now then, it’s time you boys told me what the hell happened out there."
    ALCOTT "Es hora de que me digáis qué demonios ha pasado ahí fuera."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1532
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_3c28cd0c:

    # "Clearly still deranged, I questioned if I was still dreaming..."
    "Claramente todavía trastornado, me pregunté si todavía estaba soñando..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1533
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_efd13d1e:

    # "...or was it indeed Emperor Alcott himself, standing before me and Markus, giving a damn about what we’ve got to say."
    "...o era el mismísimo emperador Alcott, de pie ante mí y Markus, importándole un bledo lo que tuviéramos que decir."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1534
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_7daffe81:

    # ALCOTT "... You two deaf?"
    ALCOTT "... ¿Sois sordos?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1535
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_1e27a783:

