    "Hice todo lo que pude para responder."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheDarkPassenger/scr_TheDarkPassenger.rpy:1536
translate es qst_TheDarkPass_ObelisksRoomCheckObelisks_031d7429:

